<form class="pneuma-vehicle-pivot">
  <p>Align the white crosshair with the vehicle’s rear axle. The default assumes the artwork faces up at 0° rotation.</p>
  <p class="notes">Coordinates include the token’s transparent padding and are measured before rotation. Left/top is 0%; right/bottom is 100%. Saving changes the turning point without moving the vehicle.</p>
  <div class="form-group"><label>Across token (%)</label><div class="form-fields"><input type="number" name="pivotX" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" value="{{x}}" required></div></div>
  <div class="form-group"><label>Down token (%)</label><div class="form-fields"><input type="number" name="pivotY" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" value="{{y}}" required></div></div>
  <button type="button" data-action="center">Use token center</button>
  <p role="alert"></p>
  <footer class="sheet-footer flexrow"><button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save pivot</button><button type="button" data-action="cancel">Cancel</button></footer>
</form>
